    <string name="summary_pref_disable_latency_extras">Stops prepared announcements, window prefetching and other background work so swipes speak sooner.</string>
    <string name="title_pref_disable_latency_pinned">Turn off pinned latency mechanisms</string>
    <string name="summary_pref_disable_latency_pinned">Stops navigation answers cutting announcements, the 100 ms speech wait cap, first-chunk speech, focus priority, the small audio buffer, focused-node reuse within one swipe, region-grained order freshness and live-tree answers in swipe bursts, and the speaking-nodes cache for edge checks.</string>
